---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import {
	COOKIES_PATH,
	LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL,
	LICENSE_PATH,
	PRIVACY_PATH,
	REFUNDS_PATH,
	SITE_BRAND,
} from '../../lib/seo';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Terms of Use"
	description="Terms of Use for iStockVisual.com: library downloads, Pro sizes, fair use, visual search, and on-device studio tools."
	heading="Terms of Use"
	lede="These terms govern iStockVisual.com — the library, accounts, paid plans, visual search, and the in-browser studio."
>
	<h2>1. Agreement</h2>
	<p>
		By using {SITE_BRAND} (“the Service”), you agree to these Terms of Use, the
		<a href={LICENSE_PATH}>Content License</a>, the <a href={PRIVACY_PATH}>Privacy Policy</a>, the
		<a href={COOKIES_PATH}>Cookie Policy</a>, and the <a href={REFUNDS_PATH}>Refund Policy</a>. If
		you do not agree, do not use the Service.
	</p>

	<h2>2. The Service</h2>
	<p>The Service has two public parts that work together:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Library.</strong> Searchable stock visuals (photos, illustrations, vectors, 3D) with
			detail pages, palettes, similar images, and downloads in JPG, PNG, WEBP, or SVG at 512, 1K,
			2K, 4K, and 8K.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Studio tools.</strong> Image Editor, Image Convert, Image Vectorizer, Social Resizer,
			Batch Watermark, and Palette Generator. These run in your browser on files you choose. Visual
			search is separate: a query photo is uploaded only to run a match.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		We host on Cloudflare. Catalog listings, previews, and available sizes can change as we add or
		retire assets. Internal generate or admin routes are not a public product and may be blocked,
		rate-limited, or changed without notice.
	</p>

	<h2>3. Accounts</h2>
	<p>
		You can browse the library and take free 512 and 1K sizes without an account. An account (email
		and password) is required to buy a plan, keep Pro access, and use signed-in download state. You
		must provide accurate information, keep your password confidential, and be responsible for
		activity on the account. You must be old enough to form a binding contract where you live.
	</p>
	<p>
		We may suspend or close accounts that are shared, sold, automated, used to scrape the catalog,
		or used to bypass size gates, watermarks, or fair-use caps.
	</p>

	<h2>4. Plans and payments</h2>
	<p>
		<strong>Free:</strong> 512 and 1K (1024 long edge) for everyone, with or without login.
		<strong>Pro / pass:</strong> 2K, 4K, and 8K while the plan is active. Current prices are in US
		dollars on <a href="/price">Pricing</a>.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Short-Term: 1-Day Pass, 7-Day Pass, 1-Month Pro</li>
		<li>Long-Term: 6-Month Pro, 12-Month Pro, Lifetime Access</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Plans are one-time charges for a stated period. Lifetime Access is a one-time payment for Pro
		downloads for as long as we operate the library; it does not auto-renew. Term plans end on their
		expiry date and do not auto-renew unless we clearly offer renewal and you accept it.
	</p>
	<p>
		6-Month, 12-Month, and Lifetime include a 7-day trial with a no-questions-asked refund. 1-Month
		Pro includes a 3-day unused trial. 1-Day and 7-Day passes refund only if unused. Details:
		<a href={REFUNDS_PATH}>Refund Policy</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>5. Fair use (HD downloads)</h2>
	<p>
		The first 100 high-resolution (2K / 4K / 8K) downloads each day are unrestricted. After that, a
		cap of 10 HD downloads per hour applies so the library stays usable and automated harvesting is
		harder. 512 and 1K are not part of that HD cap. We may tighten, pause, or restore limits if we
		see abuse, outages, or unusual load.
	</p>

	<h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>
	<p>You agree not to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Scrape, crawl, or bulk-download the library except through ordinary use of the site</li>
		<li>Circumvent paywalls, size limits, on-page watermarks, or rate limits</li>
		<li>Share, sell, or rent your login, or use another person’s account</li>
		<li>Interfere with the Service, other users, or our hosting and storage</li>
		<li>
			Upload malware, or upload content you do not have the right to use in visual search or any
			other upload
		</li>
		<li>Use the Service for unlawful, deceptive, or infringing activity</li>
		<li>
			Resell Library Content as competing stock, or claim unmodified Library Content as exclusively
			yours
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>7. Library Content, editor, and your files</h2>
	<p>
		Library Content is released under the
		<a href={LICENSE_PATH}>CC0 License</a>. Attribution is not required on any size, including Pro.
	</p>
	<p>
		The on-page editor and the Tools studio process pixels in your browser. Files you pick from disk
		are not uploaded to iStockVisual. If you start from a library preview or download, this license
		still applies. Expand on library assets is limited to Pro. Free editor exports from library
		files stay within the free long-edge sizes (512 and 1K).
	</p>
	<p>
		Visual-search query photos are uploaded only to run a match and are retained for a short period
		as described in the Privacy Policy. We do not claim ownership of your own files.
	</p>

	<h2>8. Availability and changes</h2>
	<p>
		We aim to keep the Service available, but we do not guarantee uninterrupted access, a particular
		download speed, or that any asset will remain in the library forever. We may modify features,
		plans, or these terms. Material changes will be reflected on this page with an updated date.
		Continued use after a change means you accept the revised terms.
	</p>

	<h2>9. Disclaimers</h2>
	<p>
		The Service and Library Content are provided “as is.” We do not warrant that files are
		error-free, fit for a particular campaign, or free of elements that your project might need
		extra clearance for (for example marks or likenesses you add yourself). Browser tools are a
		convenience: check outputs (hands, text, background removal, SVG traces) before you publish.
	</p>

	<h2>10. Limitation of liability</h2>
	<p>
		To the fullest extent permitted by law, iStockVisual and its operators are not liable for
		indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for lost profits, data, or
		goodwill, arising from your use of the Service. Our total liability for any claim relating to
		the Service is limited to the amount you paid us for the plan giving rise to the claim in the 12
		months before the claim, or USD $50 if you have not paid us.
	</p>
	<p>
		Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited under applicable law, including
		liability for fraud or for death or personal injury caused by negligence where such a limit is
		not allowed.
	</p>

	<h2>11. Termination</h2>
	<p>
		You may stop using the Service at any time. We may suspend or terminate access if you breach
		these terms, abuse downloads, or create legal or security risk. After a plan ends or an account
		is closed, HD download access stops. Files you already downloaded remain subject to the Content
		License.
	</p>

	<h2>12. Contact</h2>
	<p>
		Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
